WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps, I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes, I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes, I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone, whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases. I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.480
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.480 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel, Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 12]

01:51.700 --> 01:54.380
[The First Year of Tianshu]

01:54.460 --> 01:56.820
The late Emperor, Xiao Jing, and I were close from our youth.

01:57.500 --> 01:58.220
I once believed

01:59.060 --> 02:00.900
we would be lifelong friends.

02:01.820 --> 02:03.620
Xiao Jing swore to become a wise ruler,

02:04.500 --> 02:05.300
so I promised

02:06.060 --> 02:07.220
to defend the state for him.

02:07.580 --> 02:09.300
The Northern Desert gathered fifty thousand cavalry

02:10.100 --> 02:12.100
and the commander of Yunzhong requested reinforcements.

02:13.980 --> 02:14.580
I'll go.

02:17.060 --> 02:17.780
What did you say?

02:18.020 --> 02:19.180
Yunzhong is a vital frontier stronghold

02:20.060 --> 02:20.820
that we cannot afford to lose.

02:21.780 --> 02:23.140
But how can I send you

02:23.740 --> 02:24.420
to the most dangerous place

02:24.420 --> 02:25.380
just as I ascend the throne?

02:25.500 --> 02:26.820
You need a victory all the more

02:27.540 --> 02:28.980
as the new emperor.

02:34.980 --> 02:37.220
Chu Ling is hereby appointed Guard General

02:37.700 --> 02:38.700
to command the frontier troops

02:38.820 --> 02:40.820
and shall proceed to Yunzhong Prefecture today.

02:41.980 --> 02:42.740
That day,

02:43.700 --> 02:45.620
he handed me the Sword of the Loong's Roar,

02:45.700 --> 02:46.380
the symbol of power.

02:47.460 --> 02:48.700
Yet even the sharpest blade

02:49.380 --> 02:50.700
cannot sever what is destined.

02:51.780 --> 02:53.420
In my very first battle upon entering Yunzhong,

02:54.020 --> 02:55.140
I met her.

02:55.900 --> 02:57.180
Greenhorn from the South,

02:58.060 --> 02:59.300
do you dare to face me in battle?

03:10.020 --> 03:11.500
General of the Northern Desert,

03:11.900 --> 03:12.980
Alan Ruoying.

03:13.820 --> 03:14.820
Later, I saw her

03:15.660 --> 03:16.580
on a barren hill,

03:16.700 --> 03:18.380
weeping for her fallen soldiers.

03:18.860 --> 03:19.700
Only then did I realize

03:20.180 --> 03:21.580
that the fierce Rakshasa of the Northern Desert

03:21.980 --> 03:24.420
revealed a heart beyond slaughter.

03:24.540 --> 03:26.220
General Chu, walking alone at night

03:26.580 --> 03:27.540
without your guards?

03:27.980 --> 03:30.140
Aren't you afraid I'll take your head to feed my war banner?

03:30.580 --> 03:31.460
I did not come here

03:32.500 --> 03:33.500
to argue with you.

03:34.300 --> 03:34.940
I wanted

03:36.180 --> 03:36.980
to talk to you.

03:37.660 --> 03:38.340
What is there

03:39.700 --> 03:40.620
for us to talk about?

03:44.300 --> 03:45.020
Peace.

03:45.660 --> 03:46.460
Peace?

03:49.500 --> 03:50.700
I went alone to see her

03:51.740 --> 03:53.180
and gave her the jade pendant my mother had left me,

03:53.940 --> 03:56.020
engraved with the word "Peace".

03:57.100 --> 03:58.060
After some hesitation,

03:58.420 --> 03:59.380
she finally accepted it

04:00.140 --> 04:01.220
and gave me a bone whistle

04:01.340 --> 04:02.500
from the Northern Desert in return.

04:02.980 --> 04:03.580
She said

04:03.940 --> 04:05.180
she was willing to risk everything to try.

04:07.380 --> 04:08.980
However, her efforts to plead peace with the jade pendant

04:09.580 --> 04:10.540
only led to the Northern Desert King

04:10.740 --> 04:12.740
ordering her execution in front of both armies.

04:13.980 --> 04:15.660
I had no choice but to bring her back to the State of Chu.

04:16.580 --> 04:17.380
I told her

04:17.860 --> 04:19.780
that if the eagle of the desert loses its way,

04:20.860 --> 04:22.620
let it be a flower still in bloom.

04:23.780 --> 04:24.780
From then on,

04:25.220 --> 04:26.780
there was no longer Alan Ruoying,

04:27.220 --> 04:28.620
only my wife,

04:28.980 --> 04:29.980
Mu Mianhong.

04:41.620 --> 04:43.460
Then the imperial decree arrived from the Capital.

04:43.940 --> 04:45.060
His Majesty

04:45.780 --> 04:47.780
demanded that I break my own oath,

04:49.140 --> 04:49.780
saying

04:50.460 --> 04:51.460
that executing the mother while sparing the child

04:51.980 --> 04:53.340
was for my future

04:54.020 --> 04:56.980
and for the sake of my clan.

05:02.580 --> 05:03.860
What are you doing?

05:17.420 --> 05:19.580
I requested to guard Yunzhong Prefecture for the rest of my days.

05:20.500 --> 05:21.300
Without an imperial decree,

05:22.740 --> 05:24.580
I shall never cross into the Capital again.

05:28.420 --> 05:29.620
At that moment, I finally understood

05:30.300 --> 05:31.460
that even the sharpest sword

05:31.940 --> 05:33.580
cannot pierce the calculations of an emperor.

05:34.500 --> 05:35.620
Powerless,

05:36.140 --> 05:37.420
I hid her away in Cangmu Stronghold,

05:38.180 --> 05:39.500
under the guise

05:39.740 --> 05:40.660
of suppressing bandits.

05:42.940 --> 05:43.980
Deliver the victory report!

05:45.860 --> 05:47.300
The bandit leader, Mu Mianhong,

05:48.740 --> 05:49.940
leaped from the cliff

05:51.020 --> 05:52.260
to her death!

05:54.700 --> 05:57.140
To honor His Majesty's grace!

05:59.180 --> 06:00.340
On the day you were born,

06:00.820 --> 06:02.500
she whispered your name.

06:03.260 --> 06:03.860
She said...

06:04.340 --> 06:05.780
I hoped that by the time you grew up,

06:06.940 --> 06:08.660
there would be no more wars

06:09.820 --> 06:10.500
and

06:11.620 --> 06:12.940
you would be able to see the sun rise

06:12.940 --> 06:14.100
every day.

06:15.300 --> 06:16.820
Like the rising morning sun,

06:20.900 --> 06:21.660
you

06:23.300 --> 06:24.700
should be named Chu Zhao.
[*"Zhao" literally means "morning sun"]

06:26.020 --> 06:26.940
Zhao.

06:28.180 --> 06:30.020
You must grow up without a care.

06:30.980 --> 06:32.020
If anyone asks

06:32.020 --> 06:33.300
about your mother,

06:34.620 --> 06:35.580
tell them

06:37.140 --> 06:38.060
she lives

06:39.660 --> 06:41.100
in the Capital

06:42.380 --> 06:43.860
and is skilled

06:45.220 --> 06:46.420
in all the refined arts.

06:47.980 --> 06:50.020
Although she cannot watch you grow up,

06:51.500 --> 06:52.340
she loves you

06:55.100 --> 06:56.460
more than anyone else.

07:00.380 --> 07:01.140
Zhao.

07:04.340 --> 07:05.900
This is the answer you wanted.

07:07.420 --> 07:08.900
What nonsense are you talking about?

07:10.380 --> 07:11.020
Where did you hear

07:11.020 --> 07:12.140
such a story?

07:15.060 --> 07:16.100
It is not exciting at all.

07:17.900 --> 07:19.180
Do not tell it ever again.

07:19.580 --> 07:21.500
I am not lying.

07:21.860 --> 07:23.220
My mother was a noble lady from the Capital,

07:24.220 --> 07:25.220
a well-bred daughter of a prominent house,

07:25.580 --> 07:26.820
not some general from the Northern Desert.

07:34.860 --> 07:36.340
My father said you are my mother.

07:37.580 --> 07:38.220
Are you?

07:40.860 --> 07:41.780
Father,

07:42.300 --> 07:43.340
are all the stories you told me

07:43.540 --> 07:44.420
about my mother over the years

07:44.420 --> 07:45.340
lies?

07:45.940 --> 07:47.060
My mother was born into a high-ranking family

07:47.620 --> 07:49.060
and was skilled in all the refined arts.

07:49.580 --> 07:50.500
From small seal script,

07:50.900 --> 07:53.180
painting, to the guqin. Can you do any of that?

07:53.420 --> 07:54.540
If you were my mother,

07:54.740 --> 07:55.660
you'd know how to write in that script.

07:55.940 --> 07:57.220
Show me.

07:57.420 --> 07:58.460
Do it!

07:59.140 --> 07:59.900
You cannot!

08:00.740 --> 08:01.540
Your hands are fit for nothing

08:02.060 --> 08:03.020
but wielding blades and spears.

08:03.020 --> 08:04.220
You know nothing but killing!

08:04.660 --> 08:05.700
Your hands are soaked in blood!

08:05.700 --> 08:06.740
You are not my mother!

08:07.060 --> 08:08.300
She is nothing like you!

08:09.260 --> 08:09.980
Zhao.

08:10.300 --> 08:11.140
Let her finish.

08:12.540 --> 08:13.340
My mother...

08:16.180 --> 08:17.300
had delicate brows

08:18.700 --> 08:19.820
and skin like porcelain.

08:20.460 --> 08:21.380
She is

08:21.860 --> 08:24.140
the kindest mother in the world.

08:25.060 --> 08:25.940
My mother...

08:27.660 --> 08:28.780
even in death...

08:30.140 --> 08:31.300
would never abandon me.

08:31.500 --> 08:32.580
If she were still alive,

08:34.540 --> 08:35.900
she would never deceive

08:36.860 --> 08:37.540
me.

08:39.060 --> 08:39.740
Do you think

08:40.820 --> 08:41.500
you're worthy?

08:43.980 --> 08:44.940
Zhao.

08:45.020 --> 08:45.940
Did I say anything wrong?

08:46.660 --> 08:47.620
Is this not

08:47.620 --> 08:48.580
what you told me, Father?

08:49.260 --> 08:50.460
My mother was a noble lady from the Capital

08:50.580 --> 08:51.700
who died of illness.

08:51.780 --> 08:52.540
You told me

08:52.540 --> 08:54.060
every single bit of this.

08:54.500 --> 08:55.420
Or have all of these been lies

08:55.860 --> 08:56.460
you fabricated

08:56.460 --> 08:57.580
over all these years?

08:58.380 --> 08:59.620
What is real, exactly?

09:00.140 --> 09:01.820
The mother you spoke of is fake,

09:01.980 --> 09:03.460
and you hid your critical illness from me.

09:03.580 --> 09:04.620
What in the world is real?

09:04.620 --> 09:05.340
Enough!

09:07.860 --> 09:08.740
You are right.

09:09.940 --> 09:10.860
I am not your mother.

09:12.620 --> 09:13.540
The General is too ill

09:14.260 --> 09:15.820
to distinguish

09:16.980 --> 09:18.140
between stories and reality.

09:18.500 --> 09:19.220
Since my father

09:19.220 --> 09:20.180
is talking nonsense,

09:21.060 --> 09:22.020
take this worthless piece of junk

09:22.580 --> 09:23.660
that nobody wants

09:23.980 --> 09:24.940
and leave my house.

09:44.020 --> 09:44.980
Why...

09:46.340 --> 09:47.660
would you say that?

09:51.020 --> 09:51.780
She is

09:53.860 --> 09:55.580
not only your daughter,

09:57.100 --> 09:58.660
but also the Grand Princess of the State of Chu.

10:00.700 --> 10:01.460
Her mother

10:01.460 --> 10:02.780
couldn't be from the Northern Desert.

10:07.620 --> 10:08.580
And it should not be me.

10:11.140 --> 10:11.900
Alan.

10:57.620 --> 10:58.940
What right does she have to decide

10:58.940 --> 11:00.020
how I should live my life?

11:01.300 --> 11:01.940
Perhaps

11:02.620 --> 11:03.900
she only wanted to keep you safe.

11:05.500 --> 11:06.460
Safe?

11:08.460 --> 11:09.860
For nineteen years,

11:11.620 --> 11:12.940
I have spent every single day yearning for my mother

11:12.940 --> 11:14.060
who I thought was dead.

11:15.380 --> 11:16.620
Now I realize

11:19.140 --> 11:20.220
the cruelest irony

11:21.380 --> 11:22.580
isn't that I wept over an empty grave,

11:24.020 --> 11:25.220
but that she chose

11:27.980 --> 11:30.060
to cast me aside from the very beginning.

11:33.860 --> 11:34.820
When someone truly does not care,

11:37.380 --> 11:38.740
they do not even bother to lie.

11:40.660 --> 11:41.780
When I was eight,

11:43.340 --> 11:44.740
my mother sent me back to the Xie Family

11:46.140 --> 11:47.020
with a promise

11:48.140 --> 11:49.260
that she would return for me,

11:50.460 --> 11:51.300
yet

11:52.900 --> 11:53.820
she never did.

11:55.100 --> 11:56.340
Are you trying to tell me

11:57.460 --> 11:58.460
that their lies

12:00.020 --> 12:01.300
were an act of love?

12:01.780 --> 12:02.900
Lies come in many forms.

12:05.300 --> 12:06.860
Some deceive to inflict pain,

12:08.180 --> 12:09.140
while others hide the truth

12:11.820 --> 12:12.820
to protect.

12:17.860 --> 12:19.060
But I deserve the truth,

12:19.940 --> 12:20.420
and I don't want

12:20.420 --> 12:21.700
protection built on lies.

12:22.860 --> 12:23.740
And I have no desire

12:25.340 --> 12:26.340
to remain a fragile soul,

12:26.340 --> 12:27.900
forever shielded from reality.

12:29.380 --> 12:30.500
Nineteen years.

12:34.140 --> 12:36.020
They kept me in the dark for nineteen years.

12:41.980 --> 12:42.980
Now that the truth is out,

12:43.340 --> 12:44.220
what do you plan to do?

12:45.540 --> 12:46.460
Will you stay here

12:46.460 --> 12:47.180
demanding answers,

12:48.580 --> 12:49.620
or will you return

12:50.660 --> 12:51.300
to your father,

12:51.300 --> 12:52.460
who has so little time left?

12:57.380 --> 12:57.900
Zhao,

13:00.180 --> 13:01.660
trust is not

13:01.820 --> 13:02.860
for debating right and wrong.

13:10.020 --> 13:11.380
The General is fading away.

13:13.340 --> 13:14.340
Do you really want to waste

13:14.340 --> 13:15.500
these final moments placing blame?

13:17.900 --> 13:18.260
But...

13:18.260 --> 13:18.940
There are no buts.

13:19.420 --> 13:20.740
You've missed nineteen years.

13:21.820 --> 13:22.900
Do you really want

13:23.940 --> 13:25.220
to let these last moments become another regret?

13:39.500 --> 13:40.180
Uncle,

13:40.660 --> 13:42.020
are you feeling any better?

13:43.620 --> 13:44.940
It warms my heart to see you

13:45.380 --> 13:46.500
so concerned for me, Yu.

13:47.500 --> 13:48.780
I will be well again very soon.

13:52.060 --> 13:52.500
Your Majesty,

13:53.860 --> 13:55.260
Deng Yi has approved the frontier memorial

13:55.780 --> 13:56.980
and has dispatched riders posthaste

13:56.980 --> 13:57.780
to Yunzhong Prefecture.

14:02.500 --> 14:04.540
Mr. Deng never fails to deliver.

14:13.620 --> 14:14.100
Yu,

14:15.300 --> 14:16.100
do you know the parable

14:16.820 --> 14:17.860
of turning a man's own weapon

14:18.540 --> 14:19.540
against him?

14:22.260 --> 14:23.180
No matter.

14:23.980 --> 14:24.740
I shall teach you.

14:33.780 --> 14:34.260
You two,

14:34.660 --> 14:35.220
to that position.

14:35.980 --> 14:37.100
The two of you, guard that sector.

14:37.380 --> 14:38.300
Stay alert.

14:45.140 --> 14:45.700
I heard

14:45.820 --> 14:47.100
the court has approved your rewards.

14:47.300 --> 14:47.860
You'll soon be heading

14:48.020 --> 14:49.540
to the frontier to take up your post.

14:50.700 --> 14:51.540
I'll set out tomorrow.

14:51.860 --> 14:52.540
Wonderful.

14:52.820 --> 14:54.580
Whether your clan can restore its former glory

14:54.740 --> 14:55.940
depends on the feats you accomplish.

14:56.580 --> 14:57.540
This success

14:57.780 --> 14:58.540
was merely a stroke of fortune.

14:59.180 --> 14:59.860
Fortune?

15:01.300 --> 15:02.620
We were disgraced and out of favor.

15:03.060 --> 15:04.420
Promotion and reward were never certain.

15:05.140 --> 15:06.500
Fortunately, a benefactor lent their support,

15:07.340 --> 15:08.660
and given the shifting tides of the court,

15:09.140 --> 15:10.020
it was finally approved.

15:10.380 --> 15:11.060
A benefactor?

15:14.860 --> 15:15.380
Anyone who helps

15:15.380 --> 15:16.420
my family rise again

15:17.020 --> 15:17.620
is a benefactor to me.

15:19.020 --> 15:20.540
I heard

15:21.100 --> 15:23.340
the reward list

15:23.380 --> 15:24.380
was issued by the Grand Princess.

15:28.220 --> 15:29.300
She is,

15:30.260 --> 15:31.060
indeed, no ordinary woman.

15:50.660 --> 15:51.620
Apply some ointment for that burn.

15:52.100 --> 15:52.620
Father loves

15:52.620 --> 15:53.900
to eat my jujube cake,

15:55.140 --> 15:56.260
so I must finish making it.

16:04.540 --> 16:05.780
It is hard to mix this filling with chopsticks.

16:06.740 --> 16:07.540
Try using this instead.

17:46.420 --> 17:47.620
You and the General loved each other

17:48.340 --> 17:49.300
yet were forced apart.

17:50.180 --> 17:50.980
Why refuse to admit it?

17:52.060 --> 17:53.020
We did love each other.

17:54.580 --> 17:55.340
But Zhao

17:56.700 --> 17:57.260
cannot have a mother

17:57.260 --> 17:58.500
from the Northern Desert,

17:59.820 --> 18:00.900
just as Chu Ling

18:03.220 --> 18:03.860
cannot have a wife

18:03.900 --> 18:05.020
of such origin.

18:07.980 --> 18:09.540
If you truly care for them,

18:10.580 --> 18:11.860
ask no more of this.

18:29.340 --> 18:30.420
May I ask you a question?

18:34.740 --> 18:35.780
Have you ever had regrets?

18:36.260 --> 18:36.980
About what?

18:38.020 --> 18:39.300
Leaving her

18:40.820 --> 18:42.420
and letting her believe she had no mother

18:44.300 --> 18:45.540
and grow up burdened by that sorrow.

18:50.060 --> 18:50.900
Some things

18:53.260 --> 18:54.420
cannot be changed by regret alone.

18:54.460 --> 18:55.100
But what about now?

18:55.900 --> 18:57.460
She is inside,

18:58.540 --> 18:59.180
shattered

19:00.020 --> 19:00.660
and inconsolable.

19:02.300 --> 19:03.300
Can you really bear to see her like this?

19:07.420 --> 19:08.260
What can I do?

19:11.100 --> 19:12.300
Should I acknowledge who I am

19:15.100 --> 19:15.740
and force her to bear

19:15.740 --> 19:17.020
the shame of enemy blood,

19:17.780 --> 19:18.540
or should I strip her

19:20.780 --> 19:22.020
of honor

19:23.740 --> 19:25.500
and plunge her into infamy?

19:34.940 --> 19:35.620
This hairpin was meant

19:36.980 --> 19:38.580
for her coming of age.

19:39.340 --> 19:40.220
I can see

19:41.460 --> 19:42.180
that you truly cared for her,

19:43.500 --> 19:44.300
so please give it to her.

19:47.460 --> 19:48.340
Do not tell her it came from me.

19:49.900 --> 19:50.620
Just say

19:52.540 --> 19:53.340
that it is a gift

19:54.740 --> 19:55.340
from you.

20:23.980 --> 20:26.180
They are merely desperate fugitives,

20:26.540 --> 20:28.020
so what is there to fear?

20:29.860 --> 20:30.740
I only worry

20:30.740 --> 20:32.140
that they harbor resentment over Wangcheng,

20:32.780 --> 20:33.460
and refuse to cooperate

20:33.460 --> 20:34.260
with us any longer.

20:37.900 --> 20:38.620
Wangcheng?

20:39.300 --> 20:40.380
What does that have

20:41.540 --> 20:43.060
to do with us?

20:45.020 --> 20:47.140
The slaughter of those remnants of the Northern Desert

20:48.180 --> 20:49.740
was entirely Chu Zhao's doing, was it not?

20:50.580 --> 20:51.500
Indeed, Your Highness.

20:51.860 --> 20:53.020
Speaking of the Northern Desert,

20:54.220 --> 20:55.540
I have another matter

20:55.540 --> 20:56.340
to ask you about.

21:04.180 --> 21:05.820
I told you

21:06.340 --> 21:07.980
goods logged under the stables

21:08.580 --> 21:09.340
must never bear

21:09.340 --> 21:10.260
the Xiaonan Prefecture insignia again.

21:11.260 --> 21:11.940
This is my transgression.

21:12.740 --> 21:13.340
Those goods

21:14.100 --> 21:15.220
were meant to take the northern official road.

21:15.900 --> 21:17.060
I only thought a hidden mark

21:17.500 --> 21:18.140
would make it easier to identify.

21:18.620 --> 21:20.460
The fire at Wei Village five years ago

21:21.540 --> 21:23.180
wasn't enough of a lesson for you.

21:23.780 --> 21:26.220
How dare you put transport markings

21:26.220 --> 21:27.340
on the goods again?

21:27.940 --> 21:29.260
I'll handle it immediately.

21:32.700 --> 21:33.380
Have you found

21:34.740 --> 21:36.340
the boy from Wei Village

21:36.340 --> 21:36.940
named Xiang?

21:37.980 --> 21:38.660
Your Highness,

21:39.900 --> 21:40.660
not yet.

21:47.500 --> 21:48.220
Please check

21:48.500 --> 21:49.100
on my father.

21:50.140 --> 21:50.820
Please save him.

21:51.140 --> 21:51.460
Hurry.

21:51.460 --> 21:52.420
No need.

21:53.740 --> 21:55.140
Zhao, stay.

21:56.180 --> 21:58.140
I have a few words for you.

21:59.980 --> 22:00.500
Father.

22:01.020 --> 22:01.540
I am here.

22:08.580 --> 22:09.460
Zhao.

22:10.740 --> 22:12.820
Do not resent your mother.

22:13.740 --> 22:15.100
Being born in the Northern Desert

22:16.340 --> 22:17.900
was not her fault.

22:19.220 --> 22:20.860
Trying to protect you

22:23.300 --> 22:24.460
is no reason for you

22:25.740 --> 22:27.700
to hate her either.

22:29.300 --> 22:31.140
Back then, she had nowhere else to turn.

22:32.380 --> 22:33.540
Leaving you

22:35.860 --> 22:38.980
was the only way to keep you safe.

22:40.260 --> 22:41.860
Your mother is a good woman.

22:42.860 --> 22:44.220
And she loves you very much.

22:45.780 --> 22:47.580
The fault is mine...

22:49.220 --> 22:51.140
and the fault of these troubled times,

22:52.580 --> 22:54.540
which robbed her of the chance

22:55.020 --> 22:57.620
to watch you grow.

23:03.220 --> 23:03.980
Alan,

23:04.900 --> 23:06.540
come here.

23:08.180 --> 23:08.660
Father.

23:10.300 --> 23:11.140
Zhao,

23:12.300 --> 23:14.460
I do not have much time left.

23:15.820 --> 23:17.500
I ask for nothing more

23:19.100 --> 23:20.820
than the chance to bid your mother

23:22.500 --> 23:24.180
a proper farewell.

24:02.780 --> 24:04.900
When we parted all those years ago...

24:05.980 --> 24:07.140
we swore

24:07.900 --> 24:09.820
we'd never meet again.

24:11.060 --> 24:12.420
Now death draws near,

24:14.340 --> 24:15.580
and truly,

24:18.700 --> 24:20.220
we never shall.

24:48.460 --> 24:50.340
They call me

24:52.100 --> 24:53.940
the God of War,

24:58.780 --> 25:00.500
but without the woman I loved,

25:02.620 --> 25:04.300
I have been nothing more

25:06.660 --> 25:10.060
than a hollow shell for nineteen years.

25:16.540 --> 25:17.180
Alan.

25:18.220 --> 25:18.780
Yes.

25:19.860 --> 25:20.500
I'm here.

26:59.660 --> 27:00.900
The Xie Family's crest?

27:11.540 --> 27:11.980
Someone.

27:13.740 --> 27:14.100
Yes.

27:14.620 --> 27:15.140
Take this

27:15.540 --> 27:16.500
to the Army Physician for examination.

27:16.780 --> 27:17.220
Yes.

27:37.700 --> 27:38.220
Your Highness,

27:38.660 --> 27:39.660
I have examined this medicine.

27:40.020 --> 27:43.300
It is refined from several deadly poisons.

27:44.100 --> 27:44.860
For a short time,

27:45.180 --> 27:46.820
it can accelerate the flow of qi and blood,

27:47.260 --> 27:48.700
greatly enhance muscular and skeletal strength,

27:49.020 --> 27:51.700
and even give the dying a final burst of vitality.

27:52.380 --> 27:53.740
It bears a striking resemblance

27:53.740 --> 27:55.060
to a strange deadly poison

27:55.500 --> 27:57.460
recorded in ancient texts called the Bloodburn Pill.

27:58.260 --> 27:59.620
When did my father take this medicine?

28:01.940 --> 28:04.180
I remember on the Double Ninth Festival in the sixteenth year of Tianshu,

28:04.620 --> 28:06.260
the General was struck by a poisoned arrow

28:06.700 --> 28:07.940
and was on the brink of death.

28:08.300 --> 28:09.580
He took a pill

28:09.900 --> 28:11.820
that wasn't part of the army's supplies.

28:12.380 --> 28:13.300
Wasn't it examined at the time?

28:13.660 --> 28:14.660
It was an emergency

28:14.860 --> 28:15.740
and there was no time.

28:16.140 --> 28:17.300
And after he took it,

28:17.380 --> 28:18.580
nothing seemed amiss.

28:18.900 --> 28:20.620
So it was not investigated further

28:20.860 --> 28:22.500
and was only briefly recorded in the files.

28:23.700 --> 28:25.300
No wonder the General's health

28:25.540 --> 28:26.340
has been declining.

28:26.780 --> 28:28.980
This is not a life-saving medicine

28:29.140 --> 28:31.140
but a death warrant.

28:31.700 --> 28:32.660
After one takes it,

28:33.220 --> 28:34.460
toxins accumulate within the body,

28:34.660 --> 28:36.340
gradually eroding the heart in an irreversible way.

28:37.220 --> 28:38.220
Ancient records state

28:38.500 --> 28:39.620
that once this medicine is consumed,

28:39.820 --> 28:41.500
a second pill must be taken three years later

28:41.740 --> 28:43.060
in order to extend life by another three years.

28:43.620 --> 28:44.940
If the follow-up pill is not taken in time,

28:45.380 --> 28:47.860
the body will undergo rapid decline

28:48.260 --> 28:49.740
beyond any possibility of recovery.

28:52.740 --> 28:53.580
You just said

28:54.780 --> 28:56.500
that wasn't part of the army's supplies.

28:57.660 --> 28:58.980
Then where did it come from?

29:01.980 --> 29:02.540
Speak.

29:04.380 --> 29:05.020
It was given...

29:07.740 --> 29:08.500
by Jiu.

29:10.900 --> 29:11.660
In my past life,

29:12.220 --> 29:13.300
when the Anping Rebellion broke out

29:13.420 --> 29:14.740
on the eighth day of the eighth month, in the nineteenth year of Tianshu,

29:15.460 --> 29:17.020
Jiu delivered me to Xiao Xun,

29:17.260 --> 29:18.580
and rode straight back to Yunzhong Prefecture.

29:19.580 --> 29:20.340
In other words,

29:21.100 --> 29:22.260
if he provided the medicine,

29:22.820 --> 29:23.620
Father would have taken the second pill

29:23.620 --> 29:24.820
in time for the Double Ninth Festival,

29:25.020 --> 29:25.980
granting him three more years.

29:26.580 --> 29:28.140
Only to have the poison manifest in the third year of Anping.

29:29.540 --> 29:30.300
But in this life,

29:31.220 --> 29:32.300
in the nineteenth year of Tianshu,

29:32.820 --> 29:33.740
the wedding was called off,

29:34.140 --> 29:35.180
the Anping Rebellion came early,

29:35.980 --> 29:36.820
and because of me,

29:36.820 --> 29:37.980
Xie Yanlai was appointed Imperial Guard Commander,

29:38.260 --> 29:39.380
detaining him long in the Capital,

29:39.660 --> 29:41.140
making him miss the time to give Father the pill.

29:41.740 --> 29:43.500
That is why Father succumbed to the poison.

29:44.020 --> 29:45.980
Thus, the only one who could have given him the medicine

29:46.700 --> 29:47.780
is Xie Yanlai.

30:13.700 --> 30:15.140
Did you give this to my father?

30:22.540 --> 30:22.980
Yes.

30:24.460 --> 30:25.300
The Army Physician said

30:25.700 --> 30:27.060
this is a drastic drug

30:27.380 --> 30:28.620
that saves a life

30:29.620 --> 30:30.820
only to end it later.

30:31.620 --> 30:32.220
What did you say?

30:33.260 --> 30:33.980
I'm asking you...

30:35.620 --> 30:37.620
what your true intentions were

30:38.020 --> 30:39.500
when you gave my father poison?

30:43.140 --> 30:43.780
Yanlai,

30:45.340 --> 30:46.740
this secret medicine, accessible

30:46.740 --> 30:47.820
only to the direct lineage of the Xie clan,

30:49.100 --> 30:50.540
has the efficacy to revive the dying.

30:51.300 --> 30:52.460
Keep it with you

30:53.060 --> 30:54.220
just in case.

31:03.340 --> 31:03.860
The pills.

31:06.900 --> 31:07.740
You lied to me.

31:14.100 --> 31:14.620
Yes,

31:17.740 --> 31:18.940
I gave the General the pills.

31:21.740 --> 31:22.820
If you want revenge,

31:27.500 --> 31:29.060
you can take my life right now.

31:30.580 --> 31:32.380
Is this your only explanation?

31:39.060 --> 31:39.940
Xie Yanlai,

31:43.740 --> 31:44.700
do you honestly think

31:44.700 --> 31:45.860
I won't kill you?

32:25.020 --> 32:25.700
Do it.

33:43.540 --> 33:48.540
♪Broken walls and withered branches, trapped in the mire♪

33:48.540 --> 33:50.620
♪Yet still striving to reach for the sky♪

33:50.620 --> 33:52.620
♪My pride is torn down and my body is sacrificed♪

33:57.180 --> 33:58.940
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

33:58.940 --> 34:00.940
♪And roars in the blaze♪

34:00.940 --> 34:04.100
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

34:04.100 --> 34:06.420
♪Fate imprisons me♪

34:07.220 --> 34:11.260
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

34:11.740 --> 34:15.860
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

34:15.860 --> 34:19.620
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

34:19.620 --> 34:24.740
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

34:24.740 --> 34:27.220
♪With no fear of the distance♪

34:27.820 --> 34:28.580
Why?

34:31.980 --> 34:35.460
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

34:36.860 --> 34:38.340
You claimed you owed me.

34:41.180 --> 34:44.100
♪My new pride♪

34:47.100 --> 34:47.860
Now...

34:52.100 --> 34:53.780
we are square.

34:59.460 --> 35:02.340
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

35:02.340 --> 35:04.860
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

35:04.860 --> 35:07.220
♪Amidst the chaos♪

35:07.220 --> 35:11.500
♪I'll always be with you♪

